posts.body:
This is a part of the corescript for MZ:
JavaScript:
Scene_Map.prototype.isFastForward = function() {
    return (
        $gameMap.isEventRunning() &&
        !SceneManager.isSceneChanging() &&
        (Input.isLongPressed("ok") || TouchInput.isLongPressed())
    );
};
You could tie that function to a switch so that you can allow the player to fast forward during other scenes and disable to switch to stop the fast forward during the mining.
Edit: so something like this - tie it to game switch 1. When you turn switch 1 ON, you can fast forward. When you turn it OFF, it will prevent fast forwarding with the ok button or left mouse press:
JavaScript:
Scene_Map.prototype.isFastForward = function() {
    return (
        $gameSwitches.value(1) && 
        $gameMap.isEventRunning() && !SceneManager.isSceneChanging() &&
        (Input.isLongPressed("ok") || TouchInput.isLongPressed())
    );
};
